    "body": "@annevk I still found myself wanting to pass in a parameter or custom `AbortSignal` that uses the static method. My point was that you can create an `AbortSignal` with a custom timeout value, and that's it's frustrating there's no way to do that in conjunction with `AbortController` because it manages that completely.\r\n\r\nSo I still think there's likely to be some frustration around this. And that doesn't necessarily mean it's worth prioritizing -- just want to make sure my feedback/experience is clear.",
